00:16.000 --> 00:23.000
Compare your explanation with the source. Recording continues. Choose Next paragraph.

00:23.000 --> 00:33.000
Read paragraph 2 and keep its details and connections. Press Space or Hide paragraph.

00:33.000 --> 00:39.000
Recall paragraph 2 only. Press Space or Check recall. Only hidden recall speech is graded.

00:39.000 --> 00:46.000
Check against all the text read so far, then continue. The microphone stays on.

00:46.000 --> 00:48.000
Finish practice and save the recording. Whole-passage recall is optional.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Illustrative feedback, not a real attempt. Review changed qualifications. Source units earn 2 points for complete meaning, 1 for partial, or 0 for missing or changed meaning. Reading and checking are excluded. This is an AI assessment, not an LSAT score.
